# Kept IN image (needed offline): data/clean, data/*.csv roots,
# models/*.json, scripts/, tests/, docs/, mock/, app.py, *.md.
# Decisions:
# - models/: only ~20K metrics JSON, kept (no *.pkl exists; nothing to add).
# - *.md kept: all top-level docs total <100K; RUNBOOK/M1_GATE needed offline.
# - reports/ excluded: regenerated by sweep at runtime (gates mkdir -p it).
# - notebooks/eda.ipynb excluded: dev-only, 16K + kernel metadata.
# - data/raw/ (1.5M) + data/quarantine/ excluded: runtime uses data/clean.
# - .venv/ (1.6G!) excluded: image carries /opt/venv built from requirements.
data/raw/
data/quarantine/
notebooks/
reports/
.venv/
usb_backup/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
